Vendored third-party sources compiled by crates/php-dom/build.rs.

lexbor/
    The lexbor HTML/CSS/encoding library (https://github.com/lexbor/lexbor),
    Apache License 2.0 (see lexbor/LICENSE and lexbor/NOTICE).
    Copied from php-src (https://github.com/php/php-src) commit
    0c7255dc521f3776d5627c0b8ac6cffd8f7c8951, path ext/lexbor/lexbor/,
    which carries php-src's patches (ext/lexbor/patches/) on top of lexbor
    upstream commit 5291cde0d40f77e7c4ea364b7cd726269e0bf1f9.
    Only the subset php-dom compiles is kept: the .c files listed in
    ext/lexbor/config.m4 minus url/, unicode/ and punycode/ (not used by
    the DOM), plus the headers of the remaining modules and
    selectors/base.h. No source file was modified.

selectors-adapted/
    php-src's libxml2-adapted lexbor selector engine, copied unmodified
    from the same php-src commit, path
    ext/dom/lexbor/selectors-adapted/{selectors.c,selectors.h}.
    Based on lexbor (Apache License 2.0, Copyright (C) 2021-2026 Alexander
    Borisov); adaptation by Nora Dossche for PHP, distributed under
    php-src's BSD-3-Clause license (see selectors-adapted/LICENSE).
    build.rs compiles it against the Zend shim in ../csrc/phpdom_shim.h.

Set PHPRUST_LEXBOR_SRC to a directory containing a lexbor/ source tree
(e.g. php-src's ext/lexbor) to build against it instead of lexbor/ here.
